WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.939
Watch and read: Ama asks: As you read about a green mango tree, what should you

00:00:04.939 --> 00:00:05.235
imagine?

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.237
The answer is: a green mango tree. Visualising means making a picture in your mind.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:17.093
Watch and read: Ama asks: You are reading “We went to the market.” aloud. What helps

00:00:17.093 --> 00:00:18.026
you read smoothly?

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:24.188
The answer is: Read accurately at a steady pace. Reading fluency includes accuracy,

00:00:24.188 --> 00:00:25.416
pacing and expression.
